   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">This document provides information on how to install Scripture App Builder and build apps on an Apple macOS system. It is possible to build an Android app using SAB on Windows, Linux or Mac, but if you want to build an iOS app for the iPhone or iPad, you will need to build it using a Mac computer.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"/></text:p>
