       </draw:image>
      </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T28"> button to the right of the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T35">Identifiers</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T28"> header.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P227" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">Select </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">App IDs</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> and click the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Continue</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> button.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P227" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">Select </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">App</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> and clock the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Continue</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> button</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P227" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK22"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK21"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK20"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK23"/><text:span text:style-name="T29">Enter a</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33"> Description</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> of your choice.<text:line-break/>It can be the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">App Name</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> from the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">App</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T47">Ø</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T56"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Package</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> page of Scripture App Builder.</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK22"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK23"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P227" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK24"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK25"/><text:span text:style-name="T29">For Bundle ID, choose </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Explicit </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29">and enter your app package name from the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">App</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> </text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK19"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK18"/><text:span text:style-name="T47">Ø</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T56"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Package</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> page of Scripture App Builder.</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK24"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK25"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK19"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK18"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK21"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK20"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P227" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">Of the App Capabilities, there are only two that may need to be checked. <text:s/>Check the Push Notifications capability if the app uses Firebase Cloud Messaging, Verse of the Day, or Daily Reminders. <text:s/>Check the Associated Domain capability if using Deep Linking.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P227" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">Click the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Continue</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> button.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P26" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P48" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">To register a </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T38">device</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> (i.e. a specific iPhone or iPad for testing):</text:span></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum17">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P229" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">Select </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Devices</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> on the left of the page.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
